1. She used a wooden stick, which she called her "emotional support stick," during treks in a rainforest while working as a researcher. (Verbatim: "i called it my emotional support stick while i was there... the stick helps so much when you're trying to basically there weren't any paths when i was doing these treks.")

2. The stick she used was poached from poachers in a rainforest and was well-carved, spear-like, and about her height or slightly larger. (Verbatim: "i yoinked it... it was actually stolen but a good kind of stealing... it was like a wooden staff but kind of poigny at the end.")

3. She worked as a researcher in a remote rainforest where poachers operated at night, requiring her team to hide their lights to avoid encounters. (Verbatim: "you'd have to like turn off all our lights stay hidden because you don't want to run into them because they're scary.")

